{"id":"f8203c598905a7b7","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-finite-sets-elementary-not-grothendieck.md","title":"Example — 有限集是初等拓扑斯但非 Grothendieck 拓扑斯","display":"Example — 有限集是初等拓扑斯但非 Grothendieck 拓扑斯","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-finite-sets-elementary-not-grothendieck","aliases":["14-ex-finite-sets-elementary-not-grothendieck"],"display":"Example — 有限集是初等拓扑斯但非 Grothendieck 拓扑斯","source_ref":"III.7, p.143; IV.1, pp.161–166 (local reconstructed example)","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-finite-sets-elementary-not-grothendieck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-finite-sets-elementary-not-grothendieck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example — 有限集是初等拓扑斯但非 Grothendieck 拓扑斯"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"III.7, p.143; IV.1, pp.161–166 (local reconstructed example)"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FinSet}\">\\(\\mathbf{FinSet}\\)</span> 为下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 满子范畴；有限性用到有限序数的双射表达。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\omega\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\omega\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1=\\{*\\}\">\\(1=\\{*\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*=\\varnothing\">\\(*=\\varnothing\\)</span>。涉及 Hom、恒等和复合的公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\)</span>；末式全部箭头在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FinSet}\">\\(\\mathbf{FinSet}\\)</span> 中解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})=\\{A\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists b:A\\to n\\\n((\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\ (b(a)=b(a&#39;)\\Rightarrow a=a&#39;))\\land\\forall k\\in n\\ \\exists a\\in A\\ (b(a)=k))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})=\\{A\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists b:A\\to n\\\n((\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\ (b(a)=b(a&#39;)\\Rightarrow a=a&#39;))\\land\\forall k\\in n\\ \\exists a\\in A\\ (b(a)=k))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FinSet}:=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}\\left(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\{A\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b:A\\to n\\;((\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(b(a)=b(a&#39;)\\Rightarrow a=a&#39;))\\land\\forall k\\in n\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;b(a)=k)\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{FinSet}:=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}\\left(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\{A\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b:A\\to n\\;((\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(b(a)=b(a&#39;)\\Rightarrow a=a&#39;))\\land\\forall k\\in n\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;b(a)=k)\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbf{FinSet}}(A,B)=\\{(A,B,f)\\mid f:A\\to B\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbf{FinSet},A}=(A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A),\\qquad(B,C,g)\\circ_{\\mathbf{FinSet}}(A,B,f)=(A,C,g\\circ f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbf{FinSet}}(A,B)=\\{(A,B,f)\\mid f:A\\to B\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbf{FinSet},A}=(A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A),\\qquad(B,C,g)\\circ_{\\mathbf{FinSet}}(A,B,f)=(A,C,g\\circ f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{FinSet}),\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathbf{FinSet}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{FinSet}),\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathbf{FinSet}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\;\\exists(\\iota_n:1\\to Q)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\;\\forall(b_n:1\\to B)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\exists!h:Q\\to B\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h\\iota_n=b_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\;\\exists(\\iota_n:1\\to Q)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\;\\forall(b_n:1\\to B)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\exists!h:Q\\to B\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h\\iota_n=b_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限集对有限极限、有限函数集指数封闭，通常的两点特征函数分类其子集，故为初等拓扑斯。若有可数个单点集的余积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，泛性质使所有二值序列都来自函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(Q\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。右边函数只有有限多个，而不同二值序列至少有无限多个，矛盾；等价地可逐对挑二值序列迫使所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n(*)\">\\(\\iota_n(*)\\)</span> 互异，直接反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 有限。因此缺少小余积，不能为 Grothendieck 拓扑斯。原书讨论两类拓扑斯的区别，本例提供其中一个直接见证。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，III.7, p.143; IV.1, pp.161–166 (local reconstructed example)。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{FinSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\omega\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"1=\\{*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"*=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FinSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})=\\{A\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists b:A\\to n\\\n((\\forall a,a'\\in A\\ (b(a)=b(a')\\Rightarrow a=a'))\\land\\forall k\\in n\\ \\exists a\\in A\\ (b(a)=k))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FinSet}:=\\operatorname{FullSubcat}\\left(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\{A\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b:A\\to n\\;((\\forall a,a'\\in A\\;(b(a)=b(a')\\Rightarrow a=a'))\\land\\forall k\\in n\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;b(a)=k)\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbf{FinSet}}(A,B)=\\{(A,B,f)\\mid f:A\\to B\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathbf{FinSet},A}=(A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A),\\qquad(B,C,g)\\circ_{\\mathbf{FinSet}}(A,B,f)=(A,C,g\\circ f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{FinSet}),\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathbf{FinSet}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\;\\exists(\\iota_n:1\\to Q)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{FinSet})\\;\\forall(b_n:1\\to B)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\;\\exists!h:Q\\to B\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(h\\iota_n=b_n).","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n(*)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":2933,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"